# Production environment
# API_PROXY_TARGET is a RUNTIME env var set on the Railway frontend service.
# It points to the backend's Railway internal URL, e.g.
#   API_PROXY_TARGET=http://glowauraskin1.railway.internal:8080
#
# Do NOT use VITE_ prefixed vars for the backend URL in production — the
# frontend build has no proxy; the Node server (serve.cjs) handles routing.
